I think using a potion of gain level (IMHO a cursed one) is better than
using a potion of holy water for two reasons:
- potions of gain level are very valuable at very high levels
- a cursed potion of gain level causes you to lose a level (a dungeon
level that is).  It seems to imply some sort of floating.

If not a cursed potion of gain level then a blessed potion of levitation.
But definitely not holy water.

